### =========================================================================
### HYPERGRID REALTIME DATA INGESTION PIPELINE (BULK DUMMY DETECTIONS)
### =========================================================================

@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000/api

### 1. Ingest Batch Detections (Jabodetabek Arterial Roads)
# Mengirim 33 deteksi sensor AI & accelerometer yang akan langsung
# memicu auto-clustering PostGIS ke tabel pothole_clusters secara realtime.
POST {{baseUrl}}/detections/batch
Content-Type: application/json

< ./dummy-detections-payload.json

### 2. Verify Generated Clusters (Jabodetabek Bounding Box)
# Mengambil daftar klaster pothole yang otomatis teragregasi
GET {{baseUrl}}/pothole-clusters?minLat=-6.6500&minLon=106.6000&maxLat=-6.1000&maxLon=107.0500
Content-Type: application/json

### 3. Filter Severe Potholes Only (Sangat Parah)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pothole-clusters?severity=severe
Content-Type: application/json

### 4. Find Nearby Potholes (Radius 5000m dari Monas)
GET {{baseUrl}}/pothole-clusters/nearby?lat=-6.1754&lon=106.8272&radiusMeters=5000
Content-Type: application/json
